@startuml
title Состояния календарной синхронизации

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF6DA
  BorderColor #8A6D1D
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #FCE8E8
  BorderColor<<terminal>> #A33A3A
}

state DISABLED <<terminal>>

state "enabled = true" as Enabled {
  [*] --> QUEUED

  state IDLE
  state QUEUED
  state DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL
  state DISCOVERING_FOLDERS
  state DOWNLOADING
  state APPLYING
  state CANCELLING
  state BLOCKED <<terminal>>

  IDLE --> QUEUED : Sync Now / periodic trigger\nrunToken++, trigger записан
  BLOCKED --> QUEUED : ручной retry\nили periodic после TRANSIENT_EXHAUSTED

  QUEUED --> DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL : execution worker\nнет live capability
  QUEUED --> DISCOVERING_FOLDERS : execution worker\ncapability уже в process session
  DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL --> DISCOVERING_FOLDERS : OPTIONS успешен
  DISCOVERING_FOLDERS --> DOWNLOADING : FolderSync / primary calendar готовы
  DOWNLOADING --> APPLYING : получена RemoteCalendarPage

  APPLYING --> DISCOVERING_FOLDERS : MoreAvailable\nследующая page в том же slice
  APPLYING --> QUEUED : slice limit / window reduction / full reset\nили follow-up → continuation work
  APPLYING --> IDLE : terminal page успешно применена\nfollowUpRequested = false

  DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL --> QUEUED : transient failure → WorkManager retry
  DISCOVERING_FOLDERS --> QUEUED : transient/recoverable failure\nили reset → retry/continuation
  DOWNLOADING --> QUEUED : transient/capacity failure\n→ retry/continuation
  APPLYING --> QUEUED : provider capacity failure\nwindow > 1 → continuation

  QUEUED --> BLOCKED : permission / scheduling problem
  DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL --> BLOCKED : persistent connection problem
  DISCOVERING_FOLDERS --> BLOCKED : persistent folder/protocol problem
  DOWNLOADING --> BLOCKED : critical protocol problem\nили transient attempts = 5
  APPLYING --> BLOCKED : provider failure\nили minimum window = 1

  QUEUED --> CANCELLING : Cancel
  DISCOVERING_PROTOCOL --> CANCELLING : Cancel
  DISCOVERING_FOLDERS --> CANCELLING : Cancel
  DOWNLOADING --> CANCELLING : Cancel
  APPLYING --> CANCELLING : Cancel
  CANCELLING --> IDLE : cancel unique execution work
}

[*] --> DISABLED : профиль ещё не активирован
DISABLED --> Enabled : profile activation / Enable\nnew generation + runToken, initial QUEUED
Enabled --> DISABLED : Disable\ngeneration++ + runToken++, cancelAll(), cleanup

note right of Enabled
  Любой side effect разрешён только при совпадении
  persisted generation/runToken с worker fence.
  Несовпадение завершает старый worker как Obsolete.
end note

note left of Enabled
  Trigger во время QUEUED/running/cancelling
  не создаёт параллельный run: он выставляет
  followUpRequested и coalesce-ится.

  После process recreation активная phase
  нормализуется в QUEUED, а scheduling
  reconciliation восстанавливает unique work.
end note

@enduml
